{
    "title": "Bible en fran\u00e7ais courant",
    "description": "This application allows you to both read and listen to the Bible in French current.\r\n\r\nCFB is an easy Bible to read and understand who has a level of everyday language understandable to a wide audience, consisting not only of people whose mother tongue is French, but of all those who use it as a second language .\r\n\r\nThis version of the Bible is mainly for people who want to start reading the Bible. The objective of the current French version is to help the reader understand what the Scriptures say.\r\n\r\nRead the Holy Bible has never been easy, simple and free! Download now and share what you learn with your friends and family!\r\n\r\nThe Bible app running French is an audio Bible and works offline. You can read or listen to the Bible offline after downloading on your phone or tablet. You do not need Internet connection.\r\n\r\nThis application is a blessing for all Christians!\r\n\r\nMore features:\r\n\r\n1- Free download / offline use\r\nThis application of the Bible is available to everyone for free download and offline use.\r\n\r\n2- Audio Bible\r\nFor those who can not read the Bible, we have added an audio version: Listen to the complete Bible on your mobile!\r\nPress the audio icon to select the chapter or verse you want to hear. You can adjust the sound settings (speed, volume, treble, bass, etc.)\r\n\r\n3 Quick-Search\r\nYou can quickly search for any word, verse or book using our fast and efficient search system.\r\n\r\n4- Mark verses\r\nWhile reading, tap the verse you want to mark and create your own list of favorites.\r\n\r\n5- Take notes\r\nAdd notes and keep-private\r\n\r\n6 Share the Bible\r\nSend to your friends via SMS, WhatsApp or email, and share them via social networks such as Facebook, Twitter or Instagram.\r\n\r\n7 Font size\r\nChange the font size for better reading experience.\r\n\u00a0\r\n8. Night Mode\r\nActivate night mode to reduce the brightness of your screen and make it readable and less stressful Bible for your eyes\r\n\r\nFrench power in Bible will be your favorite app! Read or listen to the Bible every day and make the Holy Word a part of your everyday life!\r\n\r\nList of books of the Bible:\r\n\r\nOT: Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psa, sayings, Eccl\u00e9siaste , Song of Songs, \u00c9sa\u00efe\u00c9sa\u00efe, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi.\r\n\r\nNew Testament: Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, Jacques, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Apocalypse.",
